==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fo|non|líða}}, from {{inh|fo|gem-pro|*līþaną}}. The sense “suffer” may be borrowed from {{etyl|gml|fo}}, but derive from the same root in any case.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈlʊija]|lang=fo}}
*: {{rhymes|ʊija|lang=fo}}

===Verb===
{{fo-verb|leið|liðu|liðið}}

# to [[elapse]] (''time'')
# to [[approach]]
# to [[move]] [[smoothly]]
# to [[suffer]]

====Conjugation====
{{fo-conj-35|l|í|ð|ei|i}}

